The first Monday of any month always falls on one of the dates 1–7 of that month. The closed interval from 2025-02-16 to 2026-07-27 therefore contains every first-Monday that belongs to the months March 2025 through July 2026, and it contains no others:

- the first Monday of February 2025 lies on or before 7 February, hence strictly before the start date;
- the first Monday of July 2026 lies on or before 7 July, hence strictly before the end date;
- every intervening month contributes exactly one such Monday, all of which lie safely inside the interval.

The months in question are the 10 months March–December 2025 together with the 7 months January–July 2026, for a total of 17.

